omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bduxFNJJhTcQ7kNvwFlsmgg&_nc_oc=AdqNN-fkukLYpuaqsIiAHudOpjEV4pEjcZ_iRHnmlvPo0xTgop0QaQmsTsWvhUJNn3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGAmon0bo6Jrb1vZ2wqrGItDli4mhS1qWqNCnCcl0TiRg&oe=6A79B474"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fY7fqQTWvPgQ7kNvwFa5pSx&_nc_oc=AdoCnM0eLwVN9Y_nl4nTGcibGQfHscxAWc1RbosFISVCV1SzDFhrdf9iVu1P3GvcF20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGHurWHkKa0Nm6_WLivpYP43axPSCmxx_5JER-59WOdjA&oe=6A79B5D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1Ms8-4pKWYYQ7kNvwHY8yNK&_nc_oc=AdoXnqCO_8K3Sgwz1ZrBURzjgJbm6OeU-s702BtQAYWmLtEJKG9fyp2WnMEY2bsgnBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGU3FxUdSCuidXW8L1Hd2Kyvg44vilggPk0WzQ7FaJJFw&oe=6A79CAF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://